  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Stricter AI regulation in a major jurisdiction prompts repositioning by global investors (reducing allocations or seeking alternative domiciles), creating directional capital flows and funding stress that translate into increased exchange-rate pressure on that jurisdiction's currency.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_ai_competition</data>
  <data key="d39">currency_market_shock</data>
</edge>
