  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger domestic AI regulatory regimes prompt policymakers to impose tighter export licensing, restrictions and blacklists on AI models, software and associated components.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_ai_competition</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_econ_rivalry</data>
