  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Persistent increases in commercial rerouting raise costs and delivery times for critical components and supplies, prompting European governments to accelerate contracts with and operational integration of private unmanned‑systems firms to sustain capabilities for the Ukraine theater.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
