  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher rates of commercial rerouting increase transit times and logistics costs and raise the likelihood of missed delivery windows, directly reducing the volume and value of cross‑border shipments of advanced tech and critical components between trade partners.</data>
