  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Expansion of domestic manufacturing capacity for radars, launchers, missiles and sustainment parts shortens delivery and repair cycles and permits localized system upgrades, directly improving the operational effectiveness and coverage of integrated air‑defense systems.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_econ_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
