  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid expansion of domestic advanced manufacturing (particularly in Asia) raises industrial energy demand and imports of Middle Eastern crude for refining, producing a measurable rise in tanker transits through the Strait of Hormuz to supply refineries.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_econ_rivalry</data>
