  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">A sharp rise in prices for critical inputs (wafers, polysilicon, cobalt etc.) transmits quickly to producer and consumer prices in key manufacturing sectors, leading markets to price in a higher near‑term policy rate path to combat inflation.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_econ_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">currency_market_shock</data>
</edge>
