  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp rises in prices for wafers, specialty metals and other critical inputs increase CAPEX and OPEX for AI cloud operators and hardware startups, accelerating cash burn and reducing available liquidity and runway.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_econ_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">global_ai_competition</data>
