  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">An upward revision in short-rate expectations raises discount rates and immediate financing costs, prompting VCs and corporate investors to delay or reduce new AI funding rounds and commitments.</data>
