  <data key="d28">1</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in long-term nominal yields raises discount rates and borrowing costs for mining and processing projects, making marginal extraction and inventory buildup uneconomic and thereby reducing available critical-mineral stocks.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">currency_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_econ_rivalry</data>
</edge>
