<edge source="currency_market_shock::cross_border_capital_flo" target="global_ai_competition::ai_investment_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden pullback of cross-border portfolio and financing capital reduces available foreign venture and growth funding that directly finances AI startups and infrastructure, leading to an immediate drop in AI-directed investment flows.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">currency_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">global_ai_competition</data>
</edge>
<edge source="currency_market_shock::cross_border_capital_flo" target="russia_ukraine_war::interceptor_stock_levels" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden withdrawal of cross‑border financing from defense manufacturers or from states buying interceptors reduces working capital and delays production and procurement contracts, directly lowering available inventories of expendable interceptors for air defense.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">currency_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="currency_market_shock::cross_border_capital_flo" target="strait_hormuz_standoff::tanker_traffic" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp outflows or withdrawals of cross-border financing from regional banks, shipping firms or traders disrupt chartering and working-capital lines, causing delayed sailings, cancelled charters and fewer tankers transiting the strait.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">currency_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">strait_hormuz_standoff</data>
</edge>
<edge source="currency_market_shock::cross_border_capital_flo" target="us_china_econ_rivalry::onshore_mfg_capacity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased inbound cross-border financing and portfolio capital provide the funding and JV equity required for building or expanding domestic advanced-technology plants and semiconductor fabs, raising onshore manufacturing capacity.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">currency_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_econ_rivalry</data>
</edge>
